cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the paper below."
title: "SURGE: Scalable Upstream-decoupled Routing on GPU Engine"
abstract: >-
  A GPU-parallel solver for the implicit kinematic-wave river routing of global
  hydrological models. The serial upstream-to-downstream recursion is recast as a
  convergent fixed-point iteration, so the whole network is updated at once and a
  small number of iterations returns the serial solution.
